  ('H-11-06','One Little Ball',11,'Hafwas','phonics','Which word does this book teach?','therefore','therefrom','thereby',0,'What gets loose from Lola''s pocket?','a little ball','a coin','a sweet',0,'What does the ball do?','bounces away, faster and faster','rolls slowly','stops',0,'Write: therefore','therefore','Let''s read it again together.'),
  ('H-11-07','Not Necessary!',11,'Hafwas','phonics','Which word does this book teach?','nursery','necessary','ordinary',1,'What are they packing for?','school','putting up a tent','a party',1,'What does Remi keep saying?','pack it','not necessary','hurry',1,'Write: necessary','necessary','Let''s read it again together.'),
  ('H-11-08','The Particular Pattern',11,'Hafwas','phonics','Which word does this book teach?','popular','regular','particular',2,'What does Boma want?','any braid','a haircut','one particular braid pattern',2,'Will just any pattern do?','yes','she doesn''t mind','no, only that one',2,'Write: particular','particular','Let''s read it again together.'),
  ('H-11-09','Etim''s Big Question',11,'Hafwas','phonics','Which word does this book teach?','question','quotation','quicken',0,'What is Etim''s question?','how a fly doesn''t fall off the wall','why the sky is blue','how birds fly',0,'What does Etim do with his question?','sets out to find the answer','forgets it','asks no one',0,'Write: question','question','Let''s read it again together.'),
  ('SP-11-03','The Magician''s Helper',11,'Soundables+','phonics','A person who does magic is a...?','magicer','magician','magicist',1,'What comes to the party?','a clown','a magician','a band',1,'What is Bem like?','very fast','always late','very shy',1,'Write: magician','magician','Let''s read it again together.'),
  ('S-11-06','The Terrible Hiccups',11,'Soundables','phonics','Which word ends with ''-ible''?','terror','terrace','terrible',2,'What has begun?','a cold','a cough','Esosa''s hiccups',2,'Are they easy to stop?','yes','they stop at once','no, very hard',2,'Write: terrible','terrible','Let''s read it again together.'),
  ('SP-11-04','The String Telephone',11,'Soundables+','phonics','''Courtyard'' is court plus which word?','yard','hard','card',0,'What do Idris and Eki make?','a string telephone','a real phone','a radio',0,'Why?','shouting across the courtyard is hard','for fun only','for school',0,'Write: courtyard','courtyard','Let''s read it again together.'),
  ('SP-11-05','The Magnet',11,'Soundables+','phonics','Which word ends with ''-al''?','met','metal','mat',1,'What does Hassan find?','a coin','an old U-shaped magnet','a key',1,'What does a magnet pick up?','anything','only metal things','nothing',1,'Write: metal','metal','Let''s read it again together.'),
  ('S-11-07','The Seesaw',11,'Soundables','phonics','Which word has the /ay/ sound, spelt ''ei''?','wig','wag','weigh',2,'Who is bigger, Idara or Nanya?','Nanya','the same','Idara',2,'What is the problem on the seesaw?','it is broken','it is too small','Idara is too heavy, so Nanya stays up',2,'Write: weigh','weigh','Let''s read it again together.'),
  ('SP-11-06','The Height Chart',11,'Soundables+','phonics','Which word means the most short?','shortest','shorter','short',0,'What is on the wall?','a family height chart','a photo','a clock',0,'How does Fati feel?','she''s the shortest and grumbles','proud','tall',0,'Write: shortest','shortest','Let''s read it again together.'),
  ('SP-11-07','The Overgrown Corner',11,'Soundables+','phonics','''Overgrown'' means...?','grown a little','grown too much','not grown',1,'What is the corner like?','neat','wild and overgrown','empty',1,'What has happened there?','nothing','weeds have overrun it','it was mowed',1,'Write: overgrown','overgrown','Let''s read it again together.'),
  ('S-12-01','Chinasa!',12,'Soundables','phonics','Which word has the /uff/ sound, spelt ''ough''?','rough','though','through',0,'What is on Mum''s list?','one rough brown loaf','milk','eggs',0,'Which loaf must Nasa NOT get?','the soft white one','the brown one','a cake',0,'Write: rough','rough','Let''s read it again together.'),
  ('S-12-02','The Secret Mission',12,'Soundables','phonics','Which word has the /sh/ sound, spelt ''ci''?','press','precious','place',1,'What is the children''s mission?','clean the house','mend Nana''s wobbly chair','bake',1,'Why the rush?','it is a game','Nana is at the market and back soon','Dad said so',1,'Write: precious','precious','Let''s read it again together.'),
  ('SP-12-01','The Ferocious One',12,'Soundables+','phonics','Which word ends with the ''-cious'' sound?','ferry','fence','ferocious',2,'What is the park like?','small','dull','huge and spacious',2,'What does ''spacious'' mean?','very old','very loud','having lots of space',2,'Write: spacious','spacious','Let''s read it again together.'),
  ('H-12-01','Finally, Ese',12,'Hafwas','phonics','Which word does this book teach?','finally','family','finely',0,'What does Ese always do?','says what she thinks at once','stays quiet','waits',0,'What is her plan?','to be up first','to sleep in','to hide',0,'Write: finally','finally','Let''s read it again together.'),
  ('H-12-02','The Echo',12,'Hafwas','phonics','Which word does this book teach?','herself','myself','himself',1,'What does Hanni hear in the stairwell?','a person','her voice coming back','a bird',1,'What does she want to do?','ask Mum','work out what it is herself','run',1,'Write: myself','myself','Let''s read it again together.'),
  ('H-12-03','Osas and Spot',12,'Hafwas','phonics','Which word does this book teach?','herself','myself','himself',2,'What is the problem?','Spot is lost','Spot is ill','Spot is covered in mud',2,'What does Osas decide?','to ask Mum','to leave it','to sort it out himself',2,'Write: himself','himself','Let''s read it again together.'),
  ('H-12-04','Naza Holds Still',12,'Hafwas','phonics','Which word does this book teach?','herself','himself','myself',0,'What does Naza want?','a bird to sit on her hand','to catch it','to just feed it',0,'What must she do?','keep very still','move slowly','call it',0,'Write: herself','herself','Let''s read it again together.'),
